{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
[D]Be still, for the [F#m7]presence of the L[Bm]ord
The [Em7]Holy One is he[A]re
[D]Come bow be[F#m7]fore Him n[Bm]ow
With [Em7]reverence and fe[A]ar
[G]In [A/G]Him no s[D]in is found
[G]We [A/G]stand on [D]holy ground
[G]Be st[A]ill for the [F#m7]presence of the L[Bm]ord
The [Em7]Holy O[A]ne is h[D]ere
Be still, for the glory of the Lord
